Indra OCR Android port
Portions of preprocessing, decoding, orientation, script routing and RTL handling
are adapted from Datalab Indra, https://github.com/datalab-to/indra
commit e20355319b5aa5705a876a8d2b40aca606d7df5f, Apache License 2.0.
Modified to use Kotlin, Android/OpenCV, ONNX Runtime Java, bounded mobile batches,
and a Flutter UI. This port is not an official Datalab application.

The model weights retain their separate modified OpenRAIL-M license.
See android/app/src/main/assets/models/LICENSE.

ONNX Runtime: Microsoft, MIT License.
OpenCV: OpenCV contributors, Apache License 2.0.
